OL,3,GNEWSAThree teenagers arrested after man
OL,4,Astabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree teenage boys have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a man was stabbed in Bulwell.
OL,9,FNottinghamshire Police said it was
OL,10,Fcalled to Stock Well at about 02:50 BST
OL,11,Fon Sunday to reports of a group
OL,12,Ffighting with weapons.
OL,14,FA man in his 20s was found with stab
OL,15,Fwounds, the force added, and was taken
OL,16,Fto hospital with injuries that are not
OL,17,Fthought to be life-altering or
OL,18,Flife-threatening.
